  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The page and the chat",
      "items": [
        "The page and its API serve on loopback only: routes.py, templates/index.html.",
        "The chat has no tools of its own, only the edge's; every change it suggests is a proposal you confirm: chat.py, mcp_tools.py, settings.CHAT_ALLOWED.",
        "A secret is typed on the page; the chat may never save one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Discover",
      "items": [
        "A rehearsal lists every call and proves the secret with one call that reads nothing; a read writes a new run, never a rewrite: discovery.py.",
        "Odoo: authenticate, search_read, fields_get, search_count. Shopify: GraphQL queries only: connectors/."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Knowledge",
      "items": [
        "As-is realisation, target availability and the to-be allocation are derived from runs already here: realise.py, availability.py, allocate.py.",
        "Every change is checked by the cloud's own SHACL shapes, copied by scripts/sync-ontology.sh: knowledge.py.",
        "Sync merges three ways and writes nothing until the merge passes the shapes: sync.py. Runs and media: publish.py."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Where it is",
      "items": [
        "All paths are in ovs-dlab5-edge, under ovs_dlab5_edge/. ADR-0016 (discovery on the edge) and ADR-0018 (capabilities)."
      ]
    }
  ]
